{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059930/block/singleImage/3246619/df/01M5KJ3NSCE8QTN6RKXXY8ZVTY.jpeg?updatedAt=1792736644\"/><figcaption>屯門九巴自炒撞欄險衝入輕鐵路軌，九巴表示已即時暫停車長駕駛職務。(真.屯門友Facebook)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (23 日 ) 上午 9 時 25 分，一輛九巴往寶田邨方向行駛至近良景輕鐵站時，突然失控自炒撞路中鐵欄，更險些衝入輕鐵路軌，女司機報警求助。 九巴表示，該輛路線 258D 往屯門方向的巴士，駛至良景總站附近時撞及路旁欄杆，事件中無人受傷，已即時暫停涉事車長的駕駛職務，並正調查事件。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1059930/block/singleImage/3246630/df/01M5KJ6XFGWXTZJ90CR72WVK0S.jpeg?updatedAt=1792736644\"/><figcaption>屯門九巴自炒撞欄險衝入輕鐵路軌，九巴表示已即時暫停車長駕駛職務。(真.屯門友Facebook)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:23.874881+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T05:03:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T02:38:17.090505+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T06:39:29.330767+00:00","content_hash":"16d930e19ccfd65cb17057a59a49378812e3182e81b280629d1d0f1d53f2a6d6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T06:45:23.874881+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}